THIRD-PARTY SOURCES
    The knowledge graphs reuse only category labels and the containment relations
    between them. The hierarchies are designed for this benchmark and no code table or
    data file of any external classification is redistributed. The one external category
    list reproduced here is the seven minimum race and ethnicity categories of OMB
    Statistical Policy Directive No. 15, a U.S. federal government work that is not
    subject to copyright in the United States.
